                  "fill": "#475569",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "Festejos Aurora was born from a love for bringing people together. What started as renting a single bounce house to neighbors has grown into a full-service party equipment rental business serving the greater Houston area.",
