                  "fill": "#475569",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "We believe every family deserves a memorable celebration without the stress. That's why we handle everything — from delivery and setup to pickup — so you can focus on what matters most: enjoying the moment with your loved ones.",
