                      "fill": "#475569",
                      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                      "width": "fill_container",
                      "content": "Cancellations made 48 hours or more before the scheduled delivery will receive a full refund of the deposit. Cancellations within 48 hours are subject to a 50% cancellation fee.",
