                      "content": "# 1. Rental Agreement\n\nBy placing an order through Festejos Aurora, you agree to rent the specified equipment for the agreed-upon dates. All rentals are subject to availability and confirmation.\n\n# 2. Payment Terms\n\nA **50% deposit** is required at the time of booking to secure your reservation. The remaining 50% is due in cash upon delivery of the equipment.\n\n# 3. Cancellation Policy\n\nCancellations made 48 hours or more before the scheduled delivery will receive a full refund of the deposit.",
